  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water harvesting and Good Agriculture Practices for Improved Livelihood and Increased and Sustained Production in Matrouh Rain-fed Agricultural areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved livelihood, and increased and sustained agricultural production, of rural poor living in rain-fed areas of Northern Matrouh throughout:
1. Increased water availability and improved knowledge of good agricultural practices related to water resources management
2. Improved agricultural practices and increased agricultural production</narrative>
